  "\u003csection class=\"slide\" data-slide=\"4\" data-accent=\"#14B8A6\" data-block=\"Bloque 1\" data-topic=\"El Gran Cambio de Paradigma\" data-title=\"¿Qué Caracteriza a un Modelo Fundacional? (1/4)\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"stage\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"glow-orb\" style=\"left:1017px;top:-134px;width:403px;height:403px;background:#14B8A6;opacity:0.065;\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv style=\"position:absolute;left:57.6px;top:30px;width:710px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:#14B8A6;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"\u003eBLOQUE 1 · EL GRAN CAMBIO DE PARADIGMA\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv style=\"position:absolute;left:787px;top:30px;width:435px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:#64748B;text-align:right;\"\u003eRASGO 1 DE 4 \u0026nbsp;·\u0026nbsp; 04 / 42\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv style=\"position:absolute;left:57.6px;top:58px;width:1164px;font-family:var(--font-head);font-size:40px;font-weight:700;color:#F8FAFC;line-height:1.12;\"\u003e¿Qué caracteriza a un Modelo Fundacional?\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv style=\"position:absolute;left:57.6px;top:114px;width:1164px;font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:19px;color:#CBD5E1;line-height:1.3;\"\u003eCuatro rasgos esenciales en el orden en que los iremos desglosando.\u003c/div\u003e\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"panel panel-shadow\" style=\"left:57.6px;top:186px;width:560px;height:210px;background:#0F2E32;border:1px solid #14B8A6;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 32px;\"\u003e\n      \u003cdiv style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#14B8A6;margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e01 · EL COMBUSTIBLE\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv style=\"font-family:var(--font-head);font-size:25px;font-weight:700;color:#F8FAFC;margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003eDatos masivos y diversos\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"anim-step\" data-step=\"1\" data-anim=\"fade\" style=\"font-size:17px;color:#F8FAFC;line-height:1.4;--delay:0ms;\"\u003eAbsorbe volúmenes colosales de información multimodal sin estructurar para capturar patrones profundos del lenguaje, el código y el mundo.\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"panel panel-shadow\" style=\"left:662px;top:186px;width:560px;height:210px;background:#121622;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 32px;\"\u003e\n      \u003cdiv style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#10B981;margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e02 · EL MOTOR DE ENTRENAMIENTO\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv style=\"font-family:var(--font-head);font-size:25px;font-weight:700;color:#F8FAFC;margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003eAutosupervisión sin etiquetas\u003c/div\u003e\n      \n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"panel panel-shadow\" style=\"left:57.6px;top:420px;width:560px;height:210px;background:#121622;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 32px;\"\u003e\n      \u003cdiv style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#06B6D4;margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e03 · EL NUEVO PARADIGMA\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv style=\"font-family:var(--font-head);font-size:25px;font-weight:700;color:#F8FAFC;margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003eBase unificada «Uno para todos»\u003c/div\u003e\n      \n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"panel panel-shadow\" style=\"left:662px;top:420px;width:560px;height:210px;background:#121622;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 32px;\"\u003e\n      \u003cdiv style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#14B8A6;margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e04 · SU NATURALEZA\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv style=\"font-family:var(--font-head);font-size:25px;font-weight:700;color:#F8FAFC;margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003eCimiento central pero incompleto\u003c/div\u003e\n      \n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\n    \u003cdiv style=\"position:absolute;left:57.6px;top:678px;width:1164px;font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:12.5px;color:#64748B;\"\u003e\n      \u003cstrong style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);color:#14B8A6;\"\u003eREFERENCIA:\u003c/strong\u003e Bommasani et al. (2021, §1.1) · Chen \u0026amp; Liu (2024, §1.1) · Huyen (2025)\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/section\u003e\n",
